        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "How about having class by the sea? Sounds like a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "dream",
            "ref": "v-dream"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", doesn’t it? Well, a school in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Spain",
            "zh": "西班牙"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has made this dream "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "come true",
            "ref": "v-come-true"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for its students by moving the classroom to the beach!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Outside the school, the students sit at desks on the beach. Many of them enjoy the classes. “I feel happier and more "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "relaxed",
            "ref": "v-relaxed"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " here!” said one of them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Of course, the teachers "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "take",
            "ref": "v-take-care-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " good "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "care of",
            "ref": "v-take-care-of"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the students. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "make sure",
            "ref": "v-make-sure"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " all the kids are safe. “The children are having great fun,” said an English teacher. “They won’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "forget",
            "ref": "v-forget"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " what they have learnt here.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A class by the sea is more than just"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "不只是"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "trip",
            "ref": "v-trip"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to the beach. Some "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fishermen",
            "zh": "渔民"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " showed the students their "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fishing nets",
            "zh": "网"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". They also taught the kids how to catch fish."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Children can learn and play well in this great "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "nature",
            "ref": "v-nature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " classroom!"
          }
        ]
      },
